content.content:
- A `seat` contains only its column number as text; a row label contains only the row
  number; an `aisle` contains no text.
- `summary-item-price` contains only the price, e.g. `32.00 PLN`; `summary-item-seat`
  contains only the seat description, e.g. `12` or `Couch 3-4`; `summary-total` contains
  only `Total: <sum> PLN`. `selected-seats-count` and each `selected-seats-row` contain only
  their line.
- **Library components.** The identifiers of the five text fields, the terms checkbox and
  the datepicker may be placed either on the native `<input>` itself or on the
  UI library's component element that contains it. Identifiers of buttons go on the
  element that receives the click and is disabled when the button is disabled.
- A field's `-error` element exists in the page only while its message is shown.
- The `movies-loading` element exists in the page only while loading; `movies-empty` only
  while the empty text is shown.

